    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσεγγῠ-άω</span></b> , 
			Act.
		 only in aor.
		inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσεγγυῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					8.28
				</span></i>
			:—<i>deposit a pledge in the hands of a third
			party</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρία τάλαντα μεσεγγυηθέντα</span>
			<i>being so deposited</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				29.6
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσεγγυήσασθαι ἀργύριον</span>
			<i>have one's</i> money <i>deposited in the hands of a third
				party</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				39.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				6.50
			</span></i>.</div>
